	linkml:description "Airborne Broadcast Activity events report the activity of any aircraft or unmanned system as reported and tracked by Automatic Dependent Surveillance - Broadcast (ADS-B) receivers. Based on the ADS-B standards described in Code of Federal Regulations (CFR) Title 14 Chapter I Subchapter F Part 91 and in other general Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) supplemental orders and guidance." ;
