tectionFinding_end_time_dt> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_evidences> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_impact> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_impact_id> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_impact_score> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_is_alert> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_malware> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_malware_scan_info> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_remediation> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_resources> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_risk_details> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_risk_level> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_risk_level_id> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_risk_score> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_start_time_dt> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_status_id> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_time_dt> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_type_uid> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfDetectionFinding_vulnerabilities> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_activity_name> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_category_uid> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_confidence> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_confidence_id> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_confidence_score> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_device> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_end_time> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_finding_info> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_notes> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_start_time> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_status> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_time> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfFindingEvent_vendor_attributes> , 