	linkml:description "The normalized identifier of the finding activity. Use <code>1</code> (Create) when a finding is first generated, <code>2</code> (Update) when an existing finding is modified (e.g., severity change, new evidence), and <code>3</code> (Close) when a finding is resolved or dismissed." ;
