	linkml:description "The Vendor Attributes object can be used to represent values of attributes populated by the Vendor/Finding Provider. It can help distinguish between the vendor-provided values and consumer-updated values, of key attributes like <code>severity_id</code>.<br>The original finding producer should not populate this object. It should be populated by consuming systems that support data mutability." ;
