	linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/ocsf/OcsfKillChainPhase"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	linkml:description "The Kill Chain Phase object represents a single phase of a cyber attack, including the initial reconnaissance and planning stages up to the final objective of the attacker. It provides a detailed description of each phase and its associated activities within the broader context of a cyber attack." ;
