	linkml:description "The OCSF event type UID (<code>type_uid</code>) of the source event that this observable was extracted from. This field enables filtering and categorizing observables by their originating event type. For example: <code>300101</code> for Network Activity (class_uid 3001) with activity_id 1." ;
