	linkml:description "The actor describes the process that was the source of the inventory activity. In the case of OSINT inventory data, that could be a particular process or script that is run to scrape the OSINT or threat intelligence data. For example, it could be a Python process that runs to pull data from a MISP or Shodan API." ;
