	linkml:description "The logical grouping or isolated segment within a cloud provider's infrastructure where the resource is located. Examples include AWS partitions (aws, aws-cn, aws-us-gov), Azure cloud environments (AzureCloud, AzureUSGovernment, AzureChinaCloud), or similar logical divisions in other cloud providers." ;
