	linkml:description "SCIM provides a resource type for user resources. The core schema for user is identified using the following schema URI: <code>urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:core:2.0:User</code> as defined in RFC 7634. This attribute will capture key-value pairs for the scheme implemented in a SCIM resource. This object is inclusive of both the basic and Enterprise User Schema Extension." ;
