	linkml:description "The normalized identifier of the activity that triggered the event. Each event class defines its own set of activity values. Use 0 (Unknown) when the activity cannot be determined. Use 99 (Other) when the activity does not match any defined value, in which case activity_name must be populated with the source-specific label.<br>Refer to the <code>win_service</code> attribute for details, unless any other attribute is mentioned." ;
