	linkml:description "A LinkML model of the Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework, the open standard for normalising security events that the OCSF project publishes. It renders OCSF 1.9.0 with OCSF's own keys and integer values, so a real event validates unchanged against the class its class_uid names." ;
